@startuml overview
title Wake-up run
skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> Waiting
Waiting : wake time = earlier of\n(first event - lead time, alarm setting)
Waiting --> Ringing : wake time
Ringing --> Briefing : ringing length elapsed
Briefing --> Interval : briefing done
Interval --> Ringing : still in bed after interval\n(louder, up to the limit)
Ringing --> OutOfBed : out of bed
Briefing --> OutOfBed : out of bed
Interval --> OutOfBed : out of bed
OutOfBed --> Ringing : back in bed within the set time
OutOfBed --> [*] : set time elapsed
@enduml
